And I do think that's possible after these 13 weeks.

1143
00:40:13.430 --> 00:40:15.730
So if we look at this last block here,

1144
00:40:15.730 --> 00:40:17.350
this should say week 10-13,

1145
00:40:17.350 --> 00:40:19.050
