1157
00:40:40.290 --> 00:40:41.123
But if we look at that,

1158
00:40:41.123 --> 00:40:43.261
and we can see bench in an undulating fashion,

1159
00:40:43.261 --> 00:40:44.910
eight reps here, five reps here,

1160
00:40:44.910 --> 00:40:46.970
again, this isn't a requirement for anybody,

