1185
00:41:40.500 --> 00:41:42.360
but some of them are getting up there a little bit higher,

1186
00:41:42.360 --> 00:41:43.700
we have some seven and nines here

1187
00:41:43.700 --> 00:41:45.110
in terms of the RPEs.

1188
