00:42:13.200 --> 00:42:15.030
So back to normal in this block.

1202
00:42:15.030 --> 00:42:16.700
What I wanna highlight on this slide is,

1203
00:42:16.700 --> 00:42:18.430
I'm circling with the cursor here,

