00:42:18.430 --> 00:42:20.333
is that I showed you week 10,

1205
00:42:20.333 --> 00:42:22.870
in week 11, 12, and 13,

1206
00:42:22.870 --> 00:42:24.610
remember in week 10 there was a double

1207
00:42:24.610 --> 00:42:26.460
at an eight to nine on squat and bench?

1208
00:42:26.460 --> 00:42:28.550
I would gradually progress that day

1209
00:42:28.550 --> 00:42:30.150
to get the neuromuscular adaptations

1210
00:42:30.150 --> 00:42:31.480
and push up the 1RM.

1211
00:42:31.480 --> 00:42:33.920
In week 11, I would probably have a single

1212
00:42:33.920 --> 00:42:36.090
at an eight to nine on squat and bench.

