1214
00:42:38.270 --> 00:42:39.103
on the deadlift,

1215
00:42:39.103 --> 00:42:41.610
or three singles, it was 85% in week 10.

1216
00:42:41.610 --> 00:42:43.330
So that's gradually increasing.

1217
00:42:43.330 --> 00:42:45.420
Again, the same eight to nine RPE,

1218
00:42:45.420 --> 00:42:47.230
I still think you're gonna be able to increase load

1219
00:42:47.230 --> 00:42:49.400
