1220
00:42:49.400 --> 00:42:51.650
Because this is still a new stimulus.

1221
00:42:51.650 --> 00:42:53.540
And then, working up to a deadlift single

1222
00:42:53.540 --> 00:42:54.940
at an eight to nine on week 12.

1223
00:42:54.940 --> 00:42:56.500
So we're finally getting closer

1224
00:42:56.500 --> 00:42:58.000
